{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Spicy Eel is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked dish"],". It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],"."]],["p",["Note: This recipe is ",["l","烹饪","profitable"]," - it will result in profit when using the lowest quality ingredients."]],["p",["Spicy Eel can be traded from the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 1 ",["l","红宝石","Ruby"]," each. It may also randomly appear in ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],"' shop on ",["l","周循环","Saturdays"],", in the ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside the saloon, or in ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"],"'s rotating stock. The ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," may trade 3 Spicy Eel for 1 ",["l","古代珍宝鉴定指南","Treasure Appraisal Guide"],", provided the player has already obtained the power from that book. Up to 5 Spicy Eel may be sold by the ",["l","沙漠节","Calico Egg Merchant"]," in the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 10 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each."]],["p",["Spicy Eel can also be dropped by ",["l","飞蛇","Serpent"],"s in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," (6% chance). A ",["l","岩浆鳗鱼","Lava Eel"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," may produce 5 Spicy Eel when the population of the pond is at least 9 (3-4% chance). One Spicy Eel may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],". Five Spicy Eel can be obtained as a prize from the ",["l","镇长的庄园","Prize Machine"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l"